# Linear Task Template

Use this structure when creating or updating Linear issues so that context, scope, and implementation hints are clear.

## Template

**🎯 Context**  
Describe what needs to be done and why this matters to the user or the company.

**✅ Acceptance Criteria**  
- [ ] Step 1  
- [ ] Step 2  
- [ ] Test/Validate X  

**🔗 Implementation Notes**  
e.g. I think we can use Library X so we don't have to build this from scratch.

---

**Rules:**
- **Acceptance criteria** are checkboxes in Linear (use `- [ ]` in descriptions so they render as unchecked).
- Keep context brief but sufficient for anyone picking up the task.
- Implementation notes are optional but encouraged when they unblock or guide implementation.
